{
  "name": "Bulk Cold Email List Verifier (MX, SMTP & Catch-All Filter Before Instantly/Smartlead)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Bulk Cold Email List Verifier (MX, SMTP & Catch-All Filter Before Instantly/Smartlead)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nVerify email deliverability, DNS MX records, and catch-all status inside n8n before pushing leads to Instantly or Smartlead.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/bulk-email-verifier-cleaner`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/bulk-email-verifier-cleaner) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Bulk Email Verifier & Validator - MX & SMTP** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "d3ff0a94-cbf7-4626-ad33-fbc27e09c6e2",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Bulk Email Verifier & Validator - MX & SMTP** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "9326efc5-4265-4356-a8b5-4a7cd42ccaa4",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "df6a9bcd-2716-4b8c-ad72-b880752a65af",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "80295c9e-c539-41fd-adea-b0c8487169da",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "52ef5daf-5b24-4512-a5b9-5aaefab8659c",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"user@example.com\",\"sales@example.org\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "546ea462-0dc5-4503-a9a7-11cfaafc9388",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc144e75-6eec-4fe3-a018-b76a1c60349c",
